{"id":"pe_ril","lemma":"péril","pos":"noun","rank":4512,"glosses":["peril, danger"],"ipa":"/pe.ʁil/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f1/Fr-p%C3%A9ril.ogg/Fr-p%C3%A9ril.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"périls"},"formAudio":{"périls":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7f/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-0x010C-p%C3%A9rils.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Notre mariage est en péril.","en":"Our marriage is on the rocks.","words":[{"g":"our"},{"g":"marriage"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"in / of it"},null]},{"text":"Quelle sorte de péril encourons-nous ?","en":"What sort of danger are we in?","words":[{"g":"which?"},{"g":"sort, kind, type"},{"g":"of / from"},null,null,{"g":"we / us"}]},{"text":"Il a sauvé le chien au péril de sa vie.","en":"He rescued the dog at the risk of his own life.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to save, rescue","l":"sauver"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"dog"},{"g":"to the"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"his"},{"g":"life"}]},{"text":"Ils savaient en quels périls ils se trouvaient.","en":"They knew how much danger they were in.","words":[{"g":"they"},{"g":"to know","l":"savoir"},{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"which","l":"quel"},null,{"g":"they"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to find","l":"trouver"}]},{"text":"Ce n'est pas le genre de maladie qui met votre vie en péril.","en":"It's not the sort of illness that puts your life at risk.","words":[{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"kind"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"illness, disease"},{"g":"who"},{"g":"to put","l":"mettre"},{"g":"your, belonging to you"},{"g":"life"},{"g":"in / of it"},null]}]}